					"value": "Hi manager,\n\nFor Application_1577074476__e3e94c87fde9, theodore_lopez gathered the remaining details for the application so it could move forward. After that, with the offer already out, it was placed in waiting for the signed paperwork and supporting documents by theodore_lopez.\n\nOn 21 September, with caroline_schneider handling the next stage, it was put under document review. Around the same time, the offer was received back for the application by caroline_schneider.\n\nBy 23 September, when I checked the status, it was marked as still needing missing or corrected documents. I’ll keep an eye on it and follow up if the paperwork does not come in promptly.\n\nThanks."
